  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 301.04 Fuel gas fitter",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.04 “Fuel gas fitter” means “fuel gas fitter” as defined in RSA 153:27, III, namely, “a hearth system installation and service technician, a fuel gas installation technician, a fuel gas service technician, or a fuel gas piping installer regulated by” RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:38.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 303.04)",
